	(text "Helios specific\n  - GPIO 25 is level shifted to 5V logic level (RGB)\n  - GPIO 19 is VBUS detection\n  - GPIO 18 is not connected / used\n  - GPIO 24 is not connected / used\n  - GPIO 17 is micro LED (user controlled)\n  - Power LED (Red) disabled by default (can be bridged)"
