	(text "Coplanar differential USB pairs (JLCPCB, 2 Layers JLC0216)\n   - Dieletric=4.5\n   - H=1.4650\n   - eps=0.02\n\nJLCPCB non coplanar (W=0.4862mm, S=0.15mm)\nJLCPCB coplanar     (W=0.34mm,   S=0.15mm)\nAltium coplanar     (W=0.4086mm, S=0.127mm)\n\nDue to imperfect coplanar plane --> W = 0.381"
